  "instructions": [
    "1. Preheat grill to medium-high heat.",
    "2. In a large bowl, whisk together vinegar, olive oil, garlic powder, and onion powder.",
    "3. Add pork and sausage to the marinade, mixing well to coat.",
    "4. Thread pork and sausage onto skewers, leaving space between each piece.",
    "5. Season with black pepper to taste.",
    "6. Grill skewers for 8-10 minutes per side, or until cooked through.",
    "7. Meanwhile, heat sauerkraut in a pan over medium heat until warmed through.",
    "8. Serve skewers with sauerkraut on the side."
